Use .venv/Scripts/python.exe interpreter from your virtual environment. local not global.
pip install fastapi[all] , it will download all the related dependies.
pip freeze , show all packages with versions.
The Http method will search path from top to bottom and execute the very first matched path. (order of the path does matter.)
pip index versions <package name>  -> to list all the package versions name.
print(new_post.dict()) - > .dict() is depricated in new version of pydantic use .model_dump() for dictionary and .model_dump_json() for json.
Order of the endpoint matters: example: @app.post("/post/{id}") and @app.post("/post/latest") can cause conflict.
See the list of the status code 200 to 500(for server issue) 
Response library from fastapi
status library from fastapi, status.HTTP_404_NOT_FOUND
The dot (.) means current directory like...
(from fastapi.security.oauth2 import OAuth2PasswordRequestForm  # this only takes form data with username and password.) it requires you to insert form data into. 
datetime.utcnow() is depricated use datetime.now(timezone.utc)
query parameters = (?v=omB2JkC4QfA), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=omB2JkC4QfA
query parameters = filters the result of the request. 
?limit=8
?limit=8&skip=1
?search=my

